rget_id":"9612-1704-5b55-4bdb"},{"link_uuid":"94bfbbf6-78a9-4805-95cf-7e53f497df97","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"1119-b50a-1401-4732"},{"link_uuid":"250592f9-c8c2-444a-bc02-8f66011cb96e","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"7bd2-3dea-88e2-4297"},{"link_uuid":"c1a269cb-56e7-4938-b266-b6e0e91398ee","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"b415-eb26-3b33-474f"},{"link_uuid":"18056528-60d3-4211-8622-88f1f97682df","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"1d1f-a22c-4988-4e7a"},{"link_uuid":"497f863d-b87a-4096-b03b-231087df6d74","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"547d-3574-55e6-4c7d"},{"link_uuid":"5c493de6-ea55-4b2d-8c3b-7b58edb38012","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"3fc5-c003-4a6a-4cd3"},{"link_uuid":"89002cd9-f28c-4bcf-abed-089aeb243e70","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"d7a9-feb4-2a9b-4d69"},{"link_uuid":"ffe509b5-00f1-45fb-b126-727f9cea2d57","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"6424-2c55-2007-4769"},{"link_uuid":"e1a6a83d-8de9-4790-8228-6bcaf7ed50ce","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"eec3-3ebe-ff4b-4948"},{"link_uuid":"68caf078-2dab-45a9-96c9-cee1c9c6e643","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"d41f-ec8a-5b73-4960"},{"link_uuid":"d3b6ffb7-f10c-499e-ab77-1448489a063f","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"1727-5d44-7b31-4695"},{"link_uuid":"15745621-8283-4efc-85ef-33650f8913e4","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"0cea-ebf0-cb16-4f1a"},{"link_uuid":"9e02ccfe-3ad1-44d1-93c5-7665bcb61851","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"752c-8173-bc58-4342"},{"link_uuid":"c41b4d03-de60-4a8d-98eb-b00c03b422cd","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"093c-061f-4853-49a7"},{"link_uuid":"beece74d-5332-49e0-ab35-8ef69b14f11e","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"e7b7-4335-e7d1-4294"},{"link_uuid":"7dd5491e-7205-4c33-bead-01a2ab56268a","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"5acc-e347-3898-4634"},{"link_uuid":"dab23415-3b30-47d2-bf77-ef9e7ebdae69","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"8493-3200-e37d-4da7"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe src/rebar/_commands cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `src/rebar/_commands/__init__.py:1-12, 86-91, 145-164, 260-314` — Preserve positional safety, secret override shape, and confirmation contract. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/_confirm.py:1-29, 65-74` — Preserve flag extraction, end-of-options handling, and text/JSON behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/_init_ensures.py:1-28, 83-135, 188-222` — Preserve idempotence, foreground GC, merge-driver requirement, and compatibility stamp. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/_seam.py:1-11, 33-42, 89-151, 289-442, 465-486, 549-650` — Preserve append/finalize ownership, signing rules, batch equivalence, and initialization backstop. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/bridge_repair.py:1-29` — Preserve forward/reverse-index invariant and lossless repair contract. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/claim.py:1-9, 50-113, 182-261` — Preserve `None` versus empty assignee, review order, parent-first cascade, and claim-loss detection. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/close_autoresume.py:1-33, 209-269` — Preserve eligibility, bounded attempts, pinned ref, and cache-credit behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/close_disposition.py:1-34, 40-110, 149-194, 241-275` — Preserve disposition/completion distinction, replacement/reason rules, and signed-manifest semantics. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/close_precheck.py:62-131, 397-563, 622-643` — Preserve deterministic checks, distinct replacement remedies, verifier-fault handling, and ordering. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/compact_plan.py:1-21` — Preserve planner ownership and shared derivations. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/compact_rebuild.py:1-23` — Preserve full-log reconstruction responsibility and safety contract. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/compact_recovery.py:1-32, 131-142` — Preserve intent-journal states, idempotent recovery, and rollback behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/compact_trigger.py:1-29, 170-181` — Preserve operation-linked trigger and single-worker lock behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/compact_txn.py:1-21, 80-116, 226-242, 339-350` — Preserve authorship ledger, orphan exclusion, and whole-fold rollback invariants. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/compact.py:1-26, 178-248, 340-460` — Preserve fold selection, no-op push contract, and artifact-based outcome. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/composer_edit.py:1-16, 284-303, 437-479` — Preserve edit/tag-delta contract, parser exception, and post-commit review ordering. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/composer.py:111-134` — Preserve input contract, provenance fields, and atomic CREATE result. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_commands/doctor_locks.py:1-64, 187-198, 261-271` — Preserve reported fields, shared staleness authority, and read-only behavior. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make test`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/__init__.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/_confirm.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/_init_ensures.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/_seam.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/bridge_repair.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/claim.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/close_autoresume.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/close_disposition.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/close_precheck.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/compact_plan.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/compact_rebuild.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/compact_recovery.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/compact_trigger.py","rea